
.create-merge table Telemetry_Raw (
    Payload: dynamic,
    IoTHubDeviceId: string
)

.create-or-alter table Telemetry_Raw ingestion json mapping "TelemetryRawMapping"
```[
  {
    "column": "Payload",
    "Properties": {
      "Path": "$"
    }
  },
  {
    "column": "IoTHubDeviceId",
    "Properties": {
      "Path": "$.iothub-connection-device-id"
    }
  }
]```
